# === 你的真实资料:绝不入库 ===
.mask/
knowledge/my local knowledge/*
!knowledge/my local knowledge/放这里.md
knowledge/.extracted/
**/.extracted/

# === 凭证与运行时 ===
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.workbench/
.mcp.json
.claude/skills/
.ima-mcp/
